OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain and
OL,6,Fhill snow clearing to leave most dry
OL,7,Fwith clear spells overnight. The light
OL,8,Fwinds will allow temperatures to drop
OL,9,Faway overnight, bringing a frost for
OL,10,Fmany come dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FFrosty start for many. A cold
OL,13,Fday despite the morning sunshine. Most
OL,14,Fdry. Higher cloud feeding from south
OL,15,Ffor afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
